 &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Psych-Slice/P-Slice&quot;&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Psych-Slice/P-Slice/master/art/banner.png&quot; alt=&quot;Logo&quot; width=&quot;300&quot; height=&quot;200&quot; /&gt; &lt;/a&gt; 
 &lt;h3 align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;P-Slice Engine&lt;/h3&gt; 
 &lt;p align=&quot;center&quot;&gt; Crossover between Psych Engine and newer versions of FNF (also known as V-Slice) &lt;br /&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Psych-Slice/P-Slice/wiki&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Explore the Wiki »&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt; · &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Psych-Slice/P-Slice/issues&quot;&gt;Report Bug or Request Feature&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Psych-Slice/P-Slice/pulls&quot;&gt;Create Pull Request&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;/div&gt; 
&lt;h4&gt;Made With&lt;/h4&gt; 
&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/-HAXE-262626.svg?logo=haxe&amp;amp;style=for-the-badge&quot; /&gt; 
&lt;!-- ABOUT THE PROJECT --&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;About&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;P-Slice engine is a crossover between Psych Engine and the newest version of Friday Night Funkin.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;It&#39;s meant to bring new visuals and features from newer versions of FNF and make changes to the existing ones to make them feel closer to the ones in the V-Slice.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;(&lt;a href=&quot;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Psych-Slice/P-Slice/master/#readme-top&quot;&gt;back to top&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;Features&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;table&gt; 
 &lt;thead&gt; 
  &lt;tr&gt; 
   &lt;th&gt;V-Slice&#39;s freeplay menu&lt;/th&gt; 
   &lt;th&gt;Results screen&lt;/th&gt; 
  &lt;/tr&gt; 
 &lt;/thead&gt; 
 &lt;tbody&gt; 
  &lt;tr&gt; 
   &lt;td&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://github.com/Psych-Slice/misc/raw/main/showcase/freeplay.png?raw=true&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/td&gt; 
   &lt;td&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://github.com/Psych-Slice/misc/raw/main/showcase/result.png?raw=true&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/td&gt; 
  &lt;/tr&gt; 
  &lt;tr&gt; 
   &lt;td&gt;Character selector&lt;/td&gt; 
   &lt;td&gt;Pausable cutscenes&lt;/td&gt; 
  &lt;/tr&gt; 
  &lt;tr&gt; 
   &lt;td&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://github.com/Psych-Slice/misc/raw/main/showcase/character.png?raw=true&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/td&gt; 
   &lt;td&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://github.com/Psych-Slice/misc/raw/main/showcase/pause.png?raw=true&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/td&gt; 
  &lt;/tr&gt; 
  &lt;tr&gt; 
   &lt;td&gt;Pico&lt;/td&gt; 
   &lt;td&gt;Player editor&lt;/td&gt; 
  &lt;/tr&gt; 
